"Then I reached near my new building," I told them further.
I took my heavy luggage out of the taxi.
I slowly went near the door of my house.
Then suddenly the neighbour's door opened.
A smiling woman came out from there.
She was Asha.
Asha saw me and she smiled.
She said, 'Hello!'
'Are you the new neighbour?'
I said, 'Yes, my name is Maya.'
I told her, 'I came from Mexico.'
Asha immediately helped me with the luggage.
She lifted one big bag of mine.
Just then her dog Moti also came there.
Moti wagged his tail happily in front of me.
Asha smiled and said, 'Maya, welcome to Mumbai!'
I felt very nice on that first day.
I found my first friend in this unfamiliar city.
Amit, Neha, and Sanjay listened to my story with great interest.
